<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Oxygen says '96 net up 15.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Oxygen says '96 net up 15.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Ceylon Oxygen Ltd for the year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		 1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	  455.11   vs	402.30</p>
<p>     Net profit	 51.01   vs	 44.26</p>
<p>     Tax provision    19.99   vs	 31.12</p>
<p>NOTE - Ceylon Oxygen Ltd, Sri Lanka's main producer of industrial and medical gases, is a subsidiary of the Norwegian industrial group Norsk Hydro.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
